    @media screen and (max-width: 2500px) { body { background: #020916; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="viz-menu" id="vizMenu">
    <button class="viz-menu-toggle" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Open visualization menu">☰</button>
    <div class="viz-menu-dropdown" id="vizMenuDropdown">
      <button onclick="cycleTheme()"><span id="themeIcon">🌙</span><span id="themeLabel">Dark</span></button>
      <button onclick="downloadImage()"><span>📥</span><span>Download PNG</span></button>
      <button onclick="window.print()"><span>🖨️</span><span>Print / PDF</span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <a href="#main-content" class="skip-to-content">Skip to content</a>

  <main id="main-content" role="main" class="poster">
    <div class="content">
      <section class="topbar animate" aria-labelledby="poster-title">
        <header>
          <div class="eyebrow">2025 Global Digital Economy Brief</div>
          <h1 id="poster-title" class="title">Global Internet Usage: A Cross‑Country Comparison</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">Internet adoption varies dramatically across major digital economies — creating both mature markets and large growth frontiers.</p>
        </header>
        <aside class="source-badge" aria-label="Poster context">
          <strong>A1 Data Poster</strong>
          Penetration, population, behavior, and economic impact across leading digital economies.
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="hero-grid animate delay-1" aria-labelledby="digital-population-title">
        <article class="card hero-card">
          <div>
            <div class="stat-label" id="digital-population-title">Global internet users</div>
            <div class="hero-number">5.56<span>B</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="penetration-pill">
              <div class="pill-number">68%</div>
              <div class="pill-label">global internet penetration</div>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-text">More than two‑thirds of humanity is now online, yet the next wave of growth will come from countries where large populations still remain under-connected.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <aside class="callout-stack" aria-label="China and India online population callouts">
          <article class="card country-card">
            <div class="country">China</div>
            <div class="country-value">1.09B</div>
            <p class="country-note">Largest national online population; ~76% penetration.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card country-card">
            <div class="country">India</div>
            <div class="country-value">900M</div>
            <p class="country-note">Second largest online population; major headroom at ~62% penetration.</p>
          </article>
          <div class="combined-card">
            <strong>~1.99B users combined</strong>
            <p>China and India account for roughly 36% of the world’s internet users.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="analysis-grid animate delay-2" aria-labelledby="penetration-title">
        <article class="card chart-card">
          <div class="section-label">
            <h2 id="penetration-title">Internet Penetration Rates by Country</h2>
            <p>Ranked share of population online, revealing mature digital markets versus connectivity growth frontiers.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="chart-wrap">
            <canvas id="penetrationChart" role="img" aria-label="Horizontal ranked bar chart comparing internet penetration rates across South Korea, United Kingdom, Germany, United States, Japan, Brazil, Indonesia, China, India, and Nigeria."></canvas>
