          </div>
          <div class="mini-insight">
            <div class="kicker">Large growth runway</div>
            <div class="big">62%</div>
            <p>India’s penetration remains far below mature markets despite its 900M online population.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-insight">
            <div class="kicker">Connectivity gap</div>
