          </div>
          <div class="usage-layout">
            <div class="time-stat">
              <div class="minutes">143<span>min</span></div>
              <p>Average daily social media usage worldwide in 2025 — nearly 2.5 hours per day.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="platform-list" aria-label="Top social platforms by monthly active users">
              <div class="platform-row"><b>Facebook</b><div class="platform-bar"><i style="width:100%"></i></div><span>3.1B</span></div>
              <div class="platform-row"><b>YouTube</b><div class="platform-bar"><i style="width:81%"></i></div><span>2.5B</span></div>
              <div class="platform-row"><b>WhatsApp</b><div class="platform-bar"><i style="width:77%"></i></div><span>2.4B</span></div>
              <div class="platform-row"><b>Instagram</b><div class="platform-bar"><i style="width:65%"></i></div><span>2.0B</span></div>
              <div class="platform-row"><b>TikTok</b><div class="platform-bar"><i style="width:52%"></i></div><span>1.6B</span></div>
